{"headword":"קָצַף","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be wroth (</strong>NH id., Hiph. <em>make wrathful</em> (rare); Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܩܨܰܦ</span> <em>be wrathful</em>, also <em>be anxious, fearful</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:10\" href=\"/Genesis.41.10\">Gn 41:10</a> +, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקְצֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.6\">Lv 10:6</a> +, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.9\">Is 54:9</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹצֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.15\">Zc 1:15</a>;—<em>be wroth:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of God; abs. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.34\">Dt 1:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.16\">Is 57:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.4\">64:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.15\">Zc 1:15</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <em>against</em>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.6\">Lv 10:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:22\" href=\"/Numbers.16.22\">Nu 16:22</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.19\">Dt 9:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.6\">Is 47:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.9\">54:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.22\">La 5:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.2\">Zc 1:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.5\">Ec 5:5</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:18\" href=\"/Joshua.22.18\">Jos 22:18</a> (P)."}],"num":"1."},{"sense